61
00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.670
A branch's relaxation gives twelve.

62
00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:37.390
What should branch and bound do?

63
00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.630
Prune it: nothing in that

64
00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.950
