65
00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.110
Remember: relaxations give bounds,

66
00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:48.610
rounding can be far from optimal, and

67
00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:51.350
branch and bound proves optimality by

68
00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:51.790
